%% mmdc -i docs/content-flow.mmd -c docs/content-flow-dark.json -o docs/content-flow-dark.svg -b '#0B0B0C' -I content-flow-dark
flowchart TB
  accTitle: How content flows
  accDescr: Schema types in the repository define the embedded Sanity Studio. Editors publish pages there to the Sanity dataset. A GROQ query reads published pages through the CDN, or the bundled seed pages when no project is set, and React Server Components render each page's sections.
  Schema[Schema types in the repo]
  Schema -->|defines| Studio[Sanity Studio at /studio]
  Studio -->|publish| Dataset[(Sanity dataset)]
  Dataset -->|GROQ, CDN, 60 s| Fetch[Page fetch]
  Seed[Bundled seed pages] -->|no project ID| Fetch
  Fetch --> RSC[React Server Components]
  RSC -->|one component per section| Pages[Pages]
